minimal primes of an ideal
**************************

using { t minimalPrimes}
========================

To obtain a list of the minimal associated primes for an ideal I (i.e. the
smallest primes containing I), use the function *note minimalPrimes:
minimalPrimes,.

+---------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = QQ[w,x,y,z];                                                |
+---------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : I = ideal(w*x^2-42*y*z, x^6+12*w*y+x^3*z, w^2-47*x^4*z-47*x*z^2)|
|                                                                     |
|               2           6    3                4         2    2    |
|o2 = ideal (w*x  - 42y*z, x  + x z + 12w*y, - 47x z - 47x*z  + w )   |
|                                                                     |
|o2 : Ideal of R                                                      |
+---------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : minimalPrimes I                                                 |
|                                                                     |
|                                                      3              |
|o3 = {ideal (z, x, w), ideal (y, x, w), ideal (y, w, x  + z)}        |
|                                                                     |
|o3 : List                                                            |
+---------------------------------------------------------------------+

If the ideal given is a prime ideal then *note minimalPrimes: minimalPrimes,
will return the ideal given.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : R = ZZ/101[w..z];                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : I = ideal(w*x^2-42*y*z, x^6+12*w*y+x^3*z, w^2-47*x^4*z-47*x*z^2);       |
|                                                                             |
|o5 : Ideal of R                                                              |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : minimalPrimes I                                                         |
|                                                                             |
|                2           2   2          2      3   2   2      2 3      4  |
|o6 = {ideal (w*x  - 42y*z, x y*z  - 12w*x*z  + 11w , w x*z  + 47y z  - 43w , |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|      4       2      2   6    3                                              |
|     x z + x*z  - 43w , x  + x z + 12w*y)}                                   |
|                                                                             |
|o6 : List                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

See *note associated primes: (PrimaryDecomposition)associated primes, for
information on finding associated prime ideals and *note primary decomposition:
(PrimaryDecomposition)primary decomposition, for more information about finding
the full primary decomposition of an ideal.



