using the*note minimal primes of an ideal: minimal primes of an ideal,
======================================================================

An alternate way to find the radical of an ideal I is to take the intersection
of its minimal prime ideals. To find the *note minimal primes of an ideal:
minimal primes of an ideal, I use the function *note minimalPrimes:
minimalPrimes,. Then use *note intersect: (Macaulay2Doc)intersect,.

